{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日でじょしらく弍～時かけそば～が\n千秋楽をむかえました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古含め本当にせわしなく過ぎていった\nこの1ヶ月ちょっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いことももちろん精神的に苦しいこともありましたが、\n今は達成感と\n心からこのじょしらくに参加することができて\n良かったってそう思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はもう時間がなくて\nあまり長く書けませんが、\nまた時間を見つけて\nじょしらくのことを書くので\n少し待っていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜中に書こうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、今日のブログは\n怪我なく誰一人欠けることなく\n15人とたくさんのスタッフさん方\n関係者の方、そして応援してくださる皆さんと\n大千秋楽をむかえられて本当に良かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は無事に終わった報告ブログですが\nちゃんと後日感想書くからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心してね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/22/2837734/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなっさんからもらった\nクッキー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらこそありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/22/2837734/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若しゃんにもらったチョコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きんちゃんのは迷わず決まった！\nそう言ってくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへうれしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！時間だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ送らなきゃ！"}],"source":"archive"}